    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/9/0/90399.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 2,
    "turn_text": "With everything that's going on this week in Washington, where Kevin McCarthy was unseated as the House Speaker, I thought I would share this vintage episode recorded eight years ago with Nancy Pelosi, the most influential and skillful speaker of our times. It was a masterclass on politics, power, and how to employ it. Here's that conversation.",
