    "turn_text": "I'm here with Nancy Pelosi, the Democratic leader of the House, former speaker, who I had the pleasure to work with in my two years in Washington. I'm a city guy. I grew up in New York City. I came to Chicago in the early 70s. I love urban politics. I mostly did mayors' races for years and years and years. So Ram used to say, Ram Emanuel, People think she's a Pelosi, but really she's a dellisandre. And it's important to know that. Tell me about growing up in Baltimore in a political family. Your dad was the mayor. Your brother was the mayor. Tell me what that was like.",
